    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/b3359867a484b52a5d66d3beacfbec35.avif?t=1741815392\" data-has-big width=800 height=245 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/fe68fe46a087a7cf71c02babf2c88a05.avif?t=1741815392\" data-has-big width=800 height=277 /></span><strong>Minesweeper gone rogue!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinity Sweeper</strong> is a fresh and exciting twist on the classic Minesweeper concept, blending strategy, rogue-lite mechanics, and endless challenges into one thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of Minesweeper will instantly recognize the grid-based gameplay but will quickly discover a whole new world of danger, rewards, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/1b78c6afc85ab108cc4ee6ec5526a3cc.poster.avif?t=1741815392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/1b78c6afc85ab108cc4ee6ec5526a3cc.webm?t=1741815392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >While uncapping tiles and avoiding sudden hazards just trying to stay alive, it\u2019s a smartness, quickness test!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/4c028a25b1287b1555ebac93519c1141.avif?t=1741815392\" data-has-big width=800 height=126 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Modern Twist on Minesweeper</strong>: Classic mechanics reimagined with rogue-lite elements and fresh challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Procedurally generated levels ensure every run is unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Grid-Based Gameplay</strong>: Outsmart traps, defeat enemies, and collect rewards to power up for future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Progression</strong>: Build your arsenal and skills to delve deeper into the infinite void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Yet Rewarding</strong>: Perfect for fans of puzzle games, strategy games, and rogue-lite enthusiasts alike. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/49504653cebff023e0963385bb41b405.poster.avif?t=1741815392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/49504653cebff023e0963385bb41b405.webm?t=1741815392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make use of the in-depth stats screen to view your weak points and <strong><i>win a higher score each time!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/ec499002e5e8596f5054d62905ae0084.avif?t=1741815392\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a nostalgic fan of Minesweeper or a lover of modern indie rogue-lites, <strong>Infinity Sweeper</strong> delivers a unique and addictive experience that will keep you coming back for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/43f2707771a51d2b83a87232e3c11013.poster.avif?t=1741815392\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/43f2707771a51d2b83a87232e3c11013.webm?t=1741815392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stay alive, uncover tiles, and mark hazards in this game. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/bbcf2f44d5904e4f36c86c38363251de.poster.avif?t=1741815392\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161400/extras/bbcf2f44d5904e4f36c86c38363251de.webm?t=1741815392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2>",
